# Local Jev answer cache. Machine-local build artifact, not source.
#
# It holds no credentials — only question-hash → answer pairs — but it should
# not be committed: it would go stale silently against edited questions, and a
# stale cached answer is worse than no answer because the report cannot tell
# the difference.
.token-qualifier-cache.json

# Generated reports, when written here rather than to the repo root.
token-report.json
token-report.md
